<title>UK: Asset Management takes stake in fund company.</title>
<headline>Asset Management takes stake in fund company.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asset Management Investment Company said Wednesday it had purchased a 10.5 percent stake in fund manager City of London Investment Group.</p>
<p>City of London Investment Group specialises in emerging markets closed-end funds and has 600 million stg in assets under management.</p>
<p>The purchase price was not disclosed.</p>
<p>Asset Management Investment Company specialises in investing in the global fund management industry.</p>
<p>-- James Saft, London newsroom +44 171 542 2734</p>
</text>
